<title>MEXICO: RESEARCH ALERT - Bufete upgraded to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Bufete upgraded to buy.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Mexican construction company Bufete Industrial SA were upgraded to buy from hold by ING Barings, the brokerage said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>Analyst Hector Castillo said he was increasing his estimated 1998 construction rate, leading him to boost his earnings estimate on Bufete to $0.67 per American Depositary Receipt from a previous estimate of $0.47.</p>
<p>Castillo increased his 12-month price target to $23.50 per ADR.</p>
<p>Bufete gained 1/8 to 19-3/4 on the New York Stock Exchange on Monday.</p>
<p>((--David Luhnow, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9565))</p>
